{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》踏入結局周，該劇播出至今話題不絕，當中陳瀅脫衣戲惹爭議，通訊局曾接獲25宗投訴，另外陳瀅在劇中還要被官孝賢（張智霖飾）施以水刑及拖行，完全豁出去。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.996498+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:39:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.779793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:23.213355+00:00","content_hash":"5787d3f4dbda60e15c6532e921f22a34788a0e1625a5b99ba596f1e5c55464c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}